# API

- Module: `src/api/`; business routes under `/v1/`; `/health` stays unversioned for compose.
- Auth: env `OST_LINKER_SERVICE_TOKEN` via `X-Service-Token` header; enforce when token is set.
- Rate limiting: `slowapi` per-route decorators.
- Validation: Pydantic v2; structured JSON errors via `src/api/errors.py`.
- Unit tests for every new route; integration tests for public endpoints when DATABASE_URL is available.
